        {
            "author_association": "MEMBER",
            "body": "It only happens when `$XDG_CONFIG_HOME` is not set.\n\nThe default 'runtimepath' uses `stdpaths_get_xdg_var()`, which handles fallback when `$XDG_CONFIG_HOME` is not set.\n'packlockfile' uses `$XDG_CONFIG_HOME` directly, which doesn't handle fallback.",
            "created_at": "2026-07-09T00:45:03Z",
            "html_url": "https://github.com/neovim/neovim/issues/40645#issuecomment-4920468701",
            "id": 4920468701,
