        {
            "author_association": "NONE",
            "body": "This change will create a \"$XDG_CONFIG_HOME\" directory instead of using any environment variable. Even if the env. var is set. See the output of the `tree` command.\n\n```\n> tree\n├── $XDG_CONFIG_HOME\n│   └── nvim\n│       └── nvim-pack-lock.json\n├── init.lua -> ../../dotfiles/.config/nvim/init.lua\n├── lua\n│   ├── config\n│   ├── notes\n│   └── plugins\n├── nvim-pack-lock.json -> ../../dotfiles/.config/nvim/nvim-pack-lock.json\n└── README.md -> ../../dotfiles/.config/nvim/README.md\n```\n### System\nOS Garuda Linux\nKernel 7.1.3-zen1-1-zen\nFish 4.8.0\nNVIM v0.13.0-dev-941+g7c9222f45e",
